@startuml 任务状态机活动图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1F2933
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 任务状态机：严格单向流转，禁止逆向

start
:生成 task_id + 任务 JSON;
:写 .tmp → rename 至 **pending**;

:外网 Worker 抢占任务;
note right
  创建 processing/<task_id>.lock
  O_CREAT|O_EXCL 原子抢占
  锁文件带 PID + 时间戳
end note

:移至 **processing** (状态流转);

if (命令白/黑名单校验?) then (通过)
  if (内网是否已取消?) then (否)
    :SSH 执行设备指令;
    if (执行结果?) then (成功)
      :回填 stdout/stderr/exit_code;
      if (输出超过 64KB?) then (是)
        :大输出落 outputs/;
        :结构体只保留摘要 + 指针;
      else (否)
        :内联写入结构体;
      endif
      :移至 **completed**;
    else (失败/超时)
      :回填 error_msg + exit_code;
      :强制销毁 SSH 子进程;
      :移至 **failed**;
    endif
  else (已取消)
    :写 cancelled/<task_id>.result;
    note right
      仅审计用，不污染 completed
    end note
    :移至 **cancelled**;
  endif
else (未通过)
  :error_msg = blocked_by_policy;
  :移至 **failed**;
endif

:内网读取结果继续迭代;
:结果文件保留 10 分钟后清理;
stop

legend right
  |= 状态 |= 含义 |
  | pending | 待执行（内网写入） |
  | processing | Worker 抢占执行中 |
  | completed | 执行成功 |
  | failed | 失败 / 超时 / 策略拦截 |
  | cancelled | 内网取消 + 孤儿结果回收 |
  ================================
  状态机严格单向流转
  pending → processing → completed/failed/cancelled
  禁止逆向流转
endlegend

@enduml
